Hi all,

After the pilot we reviewed the auto-end rule. 15 minutes was far too long, people
were paying for bikes they had already left. DECISION: a ride ends automatically
when the bike has been parked and locked for 5 minutes. Please update the spec.

Also, legal reminded us that ride history containing GPS traces must be deleted
after 12 months. This is mandatory under our data protection policy.

And one more: the app must work on Android 10+ and iOS 15+.

Cheers,
